      "teacher_artifact_sha256": "44457061e4b1adcd524612b30ffa28b323a7b0c41eb27702352dc52aa84a5b38",
      "teacher_program_id": "inline-curriculum:source_musique:4aec318040e106ef9232:v1",
      "review_conclusion": "This exact standalone answer string is supported by the pinned supplied source. The captured teacher_output remains raw evidence and is not admitted unless it exactly equals an accepted answer form; no extraction from verbose prose, substring matching, or fuzzy matching is permitted. Preserve the original primary gold and source record.",
      "captured_teacher_output": "Based on the articles:\n\n1. **Rao Shushi** was a senior leader of the Communist Party of China (CPC) — so the country is **China**.\n2. The **last Song emperor** was defeated when Kublai Khan's armies conquered the Song dynasty in 1279 (Article 2).\n3. **Kublai Khan's** position was **Khagan (Great Khan) of the Mongol Empire** and he was the first Yuan emperor (Article 13).\n\nThe position held by Kublai Khan was **Great Khan** (or Khagan).\n\nAnswer: **Great Khan**",
      "captured_teacher_output_sha256": "97ddff86b80df0ce53057c3a5978b9632b46603f93a1f104bf329642eb409a8f",
      "accepted_answer_sha256": "2b41b56927f6071a69ed030450982cea635eaf497a32c1b8c53734b9192d80f3"
